sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Tgt as Target service
    participant Ag as Collector agent
    participant GW as Ingest gateway
    participant K as Kafka
    participant SP as Stream processor
    participant TS as Time-series store
    participant AL as Alert evaluator
    participant OC as On-call
    Tgt->>Ag: expose /metrics
    Ag->>Ag: scrape on interval
    Ag->>GW: batched samples
    GW->>GW: authenticate, validate labels
    GW->>K: produce to sharded topic
    K->>SP: consume partition
    SP->>TS: write downsampled series
    AL->>TS: evaluate rules on a schedule
    alt threshold breached for the full for-duration
        AL->>OC: page with runbook link
    else recovers inside the window
        AL-->>AL: reset, no page
    end
